{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"command_execution","command":"\"C:\\\\Program Files\\\\PowerShell\\\\7\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command \"Get-Content -Raw 'project/work/evidence/JG-035-opening-drafting-table/manufacturing-implementation-2026-10-05/shaft-verifier-second-review-2026-10-06.md'\"","aggregated_output":"# Shaft verifier second independent review — 2026-10-06\n\n**FIX-FIRST.** Fresh native OpenAI read-only reviewer inspected verifier SHA256\n`9f68f4502271281be1a059bef53a3bd5565d155d2e6f174125c0b53a54023e84`.\n`node --check` passed. No browser/build/GPU commands were executed by this reviewer.\nThe requested GLM native agent route failed encrypted-task delivery twice; this is\na disclosed native substitution, not a provider-diverse review.\n\n1. **Actual premature stock removal:** `kinematics.ts:224–228` counts angular\n   crossings without axial contact; `485–487` publishes that depth while `489–495`\n   correctly reports no engagement. Space 3 crosses at 2.512274 s with cutter leading\n   face 2.771876 mm, below stock start 3.1749 mm. The 2.5–2.55 and 3.4–3.45 browser\n   failures are source defects, not missed interior engagement. The parent separately\n   bundled the live sampler and reproduced depth 0.25 at 2.52 s with engagement -1\n   and leading face 2.777597 mm. Preserve retained partial stock and strict causal\n   invariants while linking gains to actual contact.\n2. **Program-cache instrumentation:** verifier `221–234` overwrites all study\n   material program keys with one identity, including ordinary tools/supports and\n   patched shafts. Restrict wrapping to progression materials, preserve the authored\n   program identity (`progression.ts:384`), and append a stable verifier suffix.\n\nAtomic entry capture (`267`) matches the CameraRig save-before-write path\n(`CameraRig.tsx:194–208`). S1–S8/N1–N4 remain represented. Literal copy, network\ninventory, visible denied-load UI and strict restoration assertions remain present.\n“Return interval” means wholly disengaged here; cutting before stock contact also\nqualifies, so the label needs correction.\n\nSource correction and fresh paired production proof remain required. Historical\nfailed reports are retained; none establishes shaft acceptance.\n\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
